  "description": "scvd.store's x402 defect vocabulary as data: every class with what it asserts, what falsifies it, whether an unpaid probe can see it, and both halves of the remediation — plus recorded 402 door fixtures to test a client against. CC BY 4.0 names, MIT code.",
